Package: focusflow
Version: 0.1.0-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-pyqt6, python3-dbus
Recommends: pipewire-audio-client-libraries | pulseaudio-utils | alsa-utils, libnotify-bin
Maintainer: FocusFlow Contributors <focusflow@localhost>
Description: Native Linux Pomodoro Timer, Task Management & Productivity Tracker
 FocusFlow is a lightweight, distraction-free desktop productivity application
 engineered specifically for Linux distributions (Debian, Parrot OS, Ubuntu).
 .
 Key features:
  - Drift-free Pomodoro timer with configurable focus and break cycles
  - Always-on-top draggable floating timer widget
  - Persistent todo system with priorities, tags, and pomodoro estimations
  - Daily, weekly, and monthly productivity statistics and visual analytics
  - System tray indicator with dynamic quick controls
  - Native Linux desktop notifications and gentle sound effects
  - 100% offline, local-first SQLite persistence with zero telemetry
